Guardian Mesh — Licensing
=========================

Copyright (c) 2026 Nrupal Akolkar

This repository is licensed under a split model. The component a
file belongs to determines its license; where a source file carries
an SPDX-License-Identifier header, that header states the same
license named here for its component.

Interface — Apache License, Version 2.0 (Apache-2.0)

  - webui/ — the web interface
  - specs/ — the protocol and architecture specifications
  - guardian_mesh_pb2.py and guardian_mesh_pb2_grpc.py — the
    generated client bindings at the repository root

  Full text: webui/LICENSE

Core — GNU Affero General Public License, version 3 or later
(AGPL-3.0-or-later)

  - guardian-meshd/ — the Rust daemon

  Full text: guardian-meshd/LICENSE

All other material in this repository is licensed under the Apache
License, Version 2.0, unless a subdirectory carries its own LICENSE
file stating otherwise.
